# Duskwatch Hunter: "When this creature enters, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature." Any creature may be chosen (CR 115.1), an
# opponent's among them: the Hunter's controller puts the counter on Bot2's Ornithopter. A Mox Ruby is no creature, so it is no
# legal target, and the Hunter itself is left without one.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Duskwatch Hunter
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Duskwatch Hunter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Mana =
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Duskwatch Hunter.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Duskwatch Hunter.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Duskwatch Hunter.Toughness = 1
